flowchart TD
    Start([User Action]) --> CheckExtension{Browser<br/>Extension?}

    CheckExtension -->|Yes| DetectExtension[Detect NIP-07<br/>Extension]
    CheckExtension -->|No| CheckStored{Stored<br/>Key?}

    DetectExtension --> RequestPubkey[Request Public Key]
    RequestPubkey --> CacheExtension[Cache Extension<br/>Reference]
    CacheExtension --> Ready([Ready to Sign])

    CheckStored -->|Yes| LoadFromIDB[Load from IndexedDB]
    CheckStored -->|No| GenerateOrImport{Generate<br/>or Import?}

    LoadFromIDB --> Decrypt[Decrypt with Password]
    Decrypt --> ValidateKey[Validate Key Pair]
    ValidateKey --> CacheSession[Cache in Session]
    CacheSession --> Ready

    GenerateOrImport -->|Generate| GenerateEntropy[Generate Entropy]
    GenerateOrImport -->|Import| ImportFormat{Import Format?}

    GenerateEntropy --> ValidateEntropy[Validate Entropy<br/>Quality]
    ValidateEntropy --> CreateKeypair[Create Key Pair]

    ImportFormat -->|nsec| DecodeNsec[Decode Bech32]
    ImportFormat -->|Hex| ValidateHex[Validate Hex]
    ImportFormat -->|Mnemonic| DeriveMnemonic[Derive from<br/>Mnemonic]

    DecodeNsec --> CreateKeypair
    ValidateHex --> CreateKeypair
    DeriveMnemonic --> CreateKeypair

    CreateKeypair --> ScoreSecurity[Calculate Security<br/>Score]
    ScoreSecurity --> Encrypt[Encrypt with<br/>AES-256-GCM]
    Encrypt --> StoreIDB[Store in IndexedDB]
    StoreIDB --> CacheSession

    Ready --> SignEvent{Sign Event?}
    SignEvent -->|Extension| ExtensionSign[window.nostr<br/>.signEvent]
    SignEvent -->|Local| LocalSign[finalizeEvent with<br/>private key]

    ExtensionSign --> Signed([Signed Event])
    LocalSign --> Signed

    style CheckExtension fill:#4A90E2
    style GenerateEntropy fill:#50C878
    style Encrypt fill:#F5A623
    style Ready fill:#50C878
    style Signed fill:#50C878
